// Rendering the buffer: home the cursor, write every row positioned absolutely
// (so a dropped byte cannot shift the picture), reset the colour and flush.
//
// These write to stdout, so their cases can only say the buffer is left as it
// was; the bytes are pinned by demos/moonbuggy's and demos/solitaire's sessions.
term_render() {
  string idstd_esc = chr(27);
  put(idstd_esc + "[H");
  idstd_term_render_body();
} return void;
